      "content": "That makes sense. So for the /s/ sound, since there's no vibration, it's basically just air passing through the teeth? Is there a specific way to feel the difference if I put my hand on my throat while saying them? I'm having a hard time distinguishing the actual \"noise\" levels between them.",
